00:13:16.590 --> 00:13:20.320
Did you keep up your training 
after you retired?

00:13:20.320 --> 00:13:21.990
Wait... You can't...

00:13:21.990 --> 00:13:25.310
Wow, it's so firm! Amazing!

00:13:25.310 --> 00:13:29.150
Hey, Momosaka-san, you shouldn't 
keep him to yourself.

00:13:29.150 --> 00:13:32.340
Oh, very well. I'll let you 
have just a tiny bit.

00:13:32.340 --> 00:13:33.570
Don't I have a say here?!

00:13:34.330 --> 00:13:35.840
It really is firm.

00:13:35.840 --> 00:13:38.870
So this is what a boy's muscles feel like.

00:13:38.870 --> 00:13:41.560
This is actually my first 
time touching them, too.

00:13:41.560 --> 00:13:43.090
How very intriguing.

00:13:46.150 --> 00:13:48.380
Shiro-chan, what's taking so long?

00:13:50.910 --> 00:13:51.890
Wha...

00:13:51.890 --> 00:13:54.650
What sort of perverted 
things are you doing?!

00:13:54.650 --> 00:13:56.710
I'm reporting you to the police!

00:13:56.710 --> 00:13:58.580
Hey! Don't say it like that!

00:13:58.580 --> 00:14:02.550
You're gonna give my 
neighbors the wrong idea!

00:14:08.090 --> 00:14:12.190
So you said this was a secret, 
but where are you taking me?

00:14:12.190 --> 00:14:14.310
Now, now, Sueharu-oniichan.

00:14:14.310 --> 00:14:17.350
You'll see soon. There's no 
need to be in such a hurry.

00:14:21.890 --> 00:14:24.680
Okay. I'll try my best.

00:14:25.070 --> 00:14:27.700
I'll try hard enough to catch up to you.

00:14:27.700 --> 00:14:29.670
Will you wait for me until then?

00:14:30.660 --> 00:14:32.060
Of course I will.

00:14:33.940 --> 00:14:36.570
At that moment, my world changed.

00:14:36.880 --> 00:14:38.840
I had a new goal,

00:14:38.840 --> 00:14:42.980
and I was able to think positively 
and change how I presented myself.

00:14:42.980 --> 00:14:48.190
That tiny change made a difference 
big enough to change my life.

00:14:48.580 --> 00:14:52.950
It would've been impossible not 
to develop special feelings

00:14:52.950 --> 00:14:55.380
for the one who led me to that point.

